{"title":"Goblin","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 5 Goblin that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/goblin-haft-binding\">Goblin Haft Binding</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=5\">Lv 5</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=5\" title=\"Pick level 5\"><td><b>5</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>20</td><td>5.1</td><td>250</td><td class=\"muted\">60 · 7.1 · 750</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>6</b></td><td>22</td><td>6.2</td><td>300</td><td class=\"muted\">66 · 8.7 · 900</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=10\" title=\"Pick level 10\"><td><b>10</b></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=12\" title=\"Pick level 12\"><td><b>12</b></td><td>37</td><td>11.1</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 15.5 · 1,800</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/goblin?lv=13\" title=\"Pick level 13\"><td><b>13</b></td><td>40</td><td>11.7</td><td>650</td><td class=\"muted\">120 · 16.4 · 1,950</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(7)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/goblin-miner\"><img src=\"data/img/8cc0476f426efa42a25e.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Goblin Miner</b><span>Lv 6</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/goblin-brute\"><img src=\"data/img/8cc0476f426efa42a25e.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Goblin Brute</b><span>Lv 8</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/goblin-mage\"><img src=\"data/img/8cc0476f426efa42a25e.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Goblin Mage</b><span>Lv 8</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/goblin-shaman\"><img src=\"data/img/8cc0476f426efa42a25e.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Goblin Shaman</b><span>Lv 8</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/goblin-king\"><img src=\"data/img/8cc0476f426efa42a25e.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Goblin King</b><span>Lv 10</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/nib-the-toolkeeper\"><img src=\"data/img/8cc0476f426efa42a25e.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Nib the Toolkeeper</b><span>Lv 12</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ratch\"><img src=\"data/img/8cc0476f426efa42a25e.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Ratch</b><span>Lv 13</span></a></div>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/8cc0476f426efa42a25e.webp\" alt=\"Goblin\"></div><h3>Goblin</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>6</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 5)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Goblin</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>22</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>6.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>300</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>13 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}